    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------MULTIPLAYER BEING CODED RIGHT NOW-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hangman.exe is a simple spin on the original Hangman. You must use your real-world microphone to communicate with the AI that has captured you, in order to guess the word it is thinking and be granted freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on a timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangman will give you 6 chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangman can understand what you say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: REQUIRES MICROPHONE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This has been a passion project of mine for some time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My first project involving 'real-world speech' puzzle mechanics, that I hope people can enjoy for a few minutes or a few hours every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing with The Hangman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And have fun :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 -Luke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------MULTIPLAYER BEING CODED RIGHT NOW-----------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hangman.exe is a simple spin on the original Hangman. You must use your real-world microphone to communicate with the AI that has captured you, in order to guess the word it is thinking and be granted freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on a timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangman will give you 6 chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangman can understand what you say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: REQUIRES MICROPHONE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This has been a passion project of mine for some time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My first project involving 'real-world speech' puzzle mechanics, that I hope people can enjoy for a few minutes or a few hours every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing with The Hangman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And have fun :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 -Luke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
